	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nfzGnSrjtKF6gTBlx",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 8, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 11, HP 8, WILL 11, PER 11, FP 11, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 4, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nr2qi8UAyIi9BjMrg",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 6 (offense 6, protection 0), threat tier minor, appearing 5."
		},
		{
			"id": "nFxXW_jKtrbP25F1v",
			"text": "Hand Crossbow: Hand Crossbow (12): 1d-1 impaling, Reach Ranged, 100. Loosed once from cover and not reloaded. The damage is the weapon's."
		},
		{
			"id": "nav-aNm2FzxVszqaG",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/svirfneblin.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nWDFXGnscHquzWcdT",
			"text": "Independent build total: 64 points of racial traits plus 34 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nHY3cOqT_kAzoZM7h",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Svirfneblin (SRD 5.1); Svirfneblin (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7LZs7ZLZzxe5hOSh",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-jYQOYFL2cnsbF8A",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 25 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-x5JC7AYTlr6uQa-",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 4 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGEaNGFXLfUNZHfII",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6nEXJqYvtmbo2sVV",
			"text": "About 0.9 m standing, which is the SM -2 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbCE-vm5qiJfmTkCS",
			"text": "ST 8 from the gnome stock: a small frame that has spent its life underground and is wiry rather than strong."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDrddjmurMqmcV0RK",
			"text": "Magic Resistance 3 is the highest in this batch and is the reason the creature has survived where it lives."
		},
		{
			"id": "ndAbTrDvGLwsXvS7I",
			"text": "Silence 3 on top of a very high Stealth, and the same distinction as the forest gnome: the advantage is what nothing hears, the skill is what nothing sees."
		},
		{
